  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: 'Next Gen Connectivity & Wireless Sensors Institute  This institute
    researches next-generation communication technologies and wireless sensor networks.
    Its mission includes developing beyond-5G and 6G communication systems, Internet
    of Things (IoT) networks, and novel sensor technologies for pervasive connectivity.
    Key focus areas: terahertz and satellite communication techniques for future
    high-speed data, low-power wide-area networks for IoT, and advanced wireless
    sensor nodes (for applications like smart cities and environmental monitoring).
    The institute aims to ensure Saudi Arabia stays at the cutting edge of communications
    tech, enabling new services (like autonomous vehicle communications or smart
    infrastructure) and supporting national digital transformation initiatives'
